Quartz Vector 2022 skin

The skin styles and layout are adapted from MediaWiki Vector (Vector 2022),
https://github.com/wikimedia/mediawiki-skins-Vector, using the source snapshot
provided in mediawiki-skins-Vector/ (skin.json requires MediaWiki >= 1.47.0).

Upstream authors: Wikimedia Foundation's Readers Web Team, Trevor Parscal,
Roan Kattouw, Alex Hollender, Bernard Wang, Clare Ming, Jan Drewniak,
Jon Robson, Nick Ray, Sam Smith, Stephen Niedzielski, Volker E., and contributors.

Reference files:
  includes/templates/skin.mustache
  resources/skins.vector.styles/variables.less
  resources/skins.vector.styles/layouts/grid.less
  resources/skins.vector.styles/typography.less

Adaptation: MediaWiki PHP/Mustache/LESS and ResourceLoader dependencies are
replaced by Quartz Preact components, SCSS and standalone browser code.
